  ('beef stew meat', 'relink', 'default', 171206, false, 'owner decision wave 14: USDA SR Legacy "Beef, chuck for stew, separable lean and fat, all grades, raw" is the real food; the packaged labels stay only as alternates when within 25 percent'),
